s against exact main source through Go overlay with Go 1.26.9, CC=/usr/bin/gcc, -count=1 -race: exit 0 (2.020 s). Worker package coverage was 91.2%; package race tests and 20 shuffled repetitions passed. Hosted checks for this submitted head remain required before integration.\n\nKeep #181 open for the remaining CPU/cap branches, shutdown/closed-pipeline behavior, precise Sync wait-entry coverage and concurrent global configuration writes. This PR is separate from frozen release-source acceptance; it creates no tag or release.\n\nDocumentation receipt\n- Canonical guidance: no change.\n- Durable learning: deterministic held-work barriers verify configured worker capacity and queued draining.\n- Evidence: anywork/worker_test.go; independent race run and retained #181 acceptance checkpoint.\n- Stale guidance removed: none.\n- Remaining uncertainty: residual #181 cases and current-head hosted CI.\n\n**Swarm checkpoint 2026-10-11 12:58 UTC:** all six hosted checks and four native jobs passed for this exact head. Root independently rehashed each of four small native receipt ZIPs against GitHub's ZIP digest and reviewed their raw CLI/Robot (and Linux JAT) lifecycle results. Independent actual native binary-byte/compiler verification remains blocked: the ~49 MB combined artifact exceeds the connector's 32 MiB transfer cap; the ordinary authenticated GitHub artifact request returned HTTP403. No old-source binaries/receipts are rebound. This PR remains draft/unmerged pending that evidence gate and dependency-safe integration under the publication hold. Main remains `727c1ff8`; no tag or release was made.","created_at":"2026-10-11T12:14:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T14:50:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"68ebfeafbcaa0f91865655eafe8577dda0316f12","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/pulls/235/commits","review_comments_url":"https